    - '*':
        reason: >-
          CVE-2026-59289 in org.springframework.graphql:spring-graphql 1.4.6 (unbounded Spring Data Connection fields). Time-boxed ignore approved by Joel O'Shea on 2026-11-17.
          No fix on Boot 3.x; the fix needs Spring for GraphQL 2.0.5 (Spring Boot 4).
          Exposure: no. No Spring Data, QueryByExampleDataFetcher or QuerydslDataFetcher; Connection fields are hand-written DGS fetchers over MyBatis.
