  SNYK-JAVA-ORGSPRINGFRAMEWORK-19267079:
    - '*':
        reason: >-
          CVE-2026-47889 in org.springframework:spring-web 6.2.19 (JettyCoreServerHttpResponse cookies). Time-boxed ignore approved by Joel O'Shea on 2026-11-17.
          No fix on Spring 6.2.x; the fix needs Spring Framework 7.0.9 (Spring Boot 4).
          Exposure: no. The app runs on Tomcat, not Jetty, and sets no cookies (stateless JWT in the Authorization header).
