        reason: >-
          CVE-2026-47883 in org.springframework:spring-webmvc 6.2.19 (open redirect in UrlHandlerFilter with broad patterns). Time-boxed ignore approved by Joel O'Shea on 2026-11-17.
          No fix on Spring 6.2.x; the fix needs Spring Framework 7.0.9 (Spring Boot 4).
          Exposure: UNCLEAR, revisit. TrailingSlashConfig registers UrlHandlerFilter on /** but in wrapRequest mode (no redirects); //host and /\host probes returned 400 with no Location.
